	(text "MOTOR1 and MOTOR2 need to operate at 200mA, so we'll current-limit at 250mA\n\nMOROR3 and MOTOR4 need to operate at 500mA, so we'll current-limit to 600mA\n\nWe've only got 1ohm and 0.1ohm resistors to work with without incurring,\nextended feed, so we'll have to settle for 400mA and 1A limit respectively."
